---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Studio — PATTERNFORMS"
  description="An architecture practice with in-house engineering, and the genesis of everything PatternForms makes."
  canonical="https://pattern-forms-website.vercel.app/studio"
>
  <div class="pf-page">
    <section class="pf-container">

      <div class="pf-rail-grid">
        <div class="pf-rail">
          <p class="pf-eyebrow" style="margin-bottom: 16px;">03 · STUDIO</p>
          <div><strong>DISCIPLINE</strong></div>
          <div>ARCHITECTURE<br />+ ENGINEERING</div>
          <div style="margin-top: 8px;"><strong>BUILT FORM</strong></div>
          <div>RESIDENTIAL<br />1 + 2 STOREY</div>
          <div style="margin-top: 8px;"><strong>COMPONENTS</strong></div>
          <div>IN-HOUSE</div>
        </div>

        <div class="pf-studio-body">
          <p class="pf-body">
            We are an architecture practice with in-house engineering, and the genesis of everything we make.
          </p>
          <p class="pf-body">
            We design single and double-storey dwellings — and any associated project work —
            built and assembled from our own in-house components. A system configured to your
            requirements, your site, and your taste.
          </p>
          <p class="pf-body">
            Architecture and engineering work side by side here, which means fewer hand-offs
            and a design that is ready to assemble from the first concept.
          </p>
          <p class="pf-body">
            Our practice is energised by new challenges and by individual character —
            which we believe results in bespoke and celebrated buildings.
          </p>
          <p class="pf-body" style="color: var(--pf-grey-60);">
            Our systems and methodology serve one purpose: to make good design easier
            to repeat — like a pattern — not to flatten it.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .pf-studio-body {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 36px;
    max-width: 720px;
  }
</style>
